              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "MqOcn",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1096,
              "content": "The antipattern /before reproduces, as a shape: one <img> per star, no alt; avatars as <img>, no alt; a link to a non-canonical URL; one hreflang declared twice; JSON-LD that does not parse.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mpSul",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1096,
              "content": "/after: one RatingStars per rating (role=img, aria-label 'Rated 4.5 out of 5'), initials instead of avatar images, one canonical, reciprocal alternates, valid JSON-LD.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "o5jDG",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1096,
              "content": "Stars: $rating filled, $border-strong empty; a half star splits at 50%. Rating colour = --c-warning-800 light, --c-amber-300 dark (≥ 3:1 against bg, bg-subtle and border-strong in both themes).",
